On 17 Oct 2004 23:40:13 -0700, mdmota@yahoo.com.au (Mark) wrote:

>Im an average Nethack player, who with the help of the spoilers, have
>figured out how most things work, but am still unsure of how often /
>how many things you can charge with the PYEC.

The amount of time between the ability to use the artifact is variable.
Normally, you should be able to use it after some time, but there are cases
where you get unlucky and you have to wait a very long time before it can
be used again (e.g. 2500 turns or so...)

> Is there a limit to the number of things you can charge with it? 

You can charge items as many times as you want, but some items have a limit
on the number of recharges. Unless you are playing an old version of
Nethack, the number of previous charging attempts is displayed to the left
(including attempts to charge while cursed, so be careful.)



